      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAYWYN'S JAGUAR (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing eighth (31.08) in a Grade 5 at this track. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. INDIAN RUPEE (3) hit the ground running from out wide and on speed early but faded and swamped late when 5th at this track in Mix 5 company. Can figure in the finish. ALLEY ACRES (2) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when eighth at Q Lakeside over 390m behind Rein Me In (22.71) in a Restricted WIN. Comes through a solid form race last start. Key player if finds best.",
